<h3 id="page-builder-widgets">Page Builder Widgets</h3>
<p>
	You can use almost any widget in the Page Builder. Let's take a look at few not so straight forward ones.
</p>
<h4>Visual Editor Widget</h4>
<p>
	The <strong>Visual Editor</strong> widget comes from the recommended <strong>Black Studio TinyMCE Widget</strong> plugin. Install and activate it in <strong>Appearance &gt; Install Plugins</strong> before you import the demo, because the demo uses this widget for much of its text. Visual Editor will create you the same editor environment as a normal WordPress editor does. You can use this widget if you want normal text editing options.
</p>

